13:["$","ul","ul-3",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Dataset"}],"：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"它定义了\"数据集\"是什么"}],"。这是一个抽象类，你只需要继承它并实现两个方法：",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"__len__"}],"(返回数据集大小) 和 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"__getitem__"}]," (根据索引 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"idx"}]," 返回一条数据)。它解决了“如何获取单条数据”的问题，将数据访问的逻辑封装起来。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"DataLoader"}],"：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"它定义了\"如何使用数据集\""}],"。它接收一个 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Dataset"}]," 对象，并在此基础上，优雅地解决了所有工程问题：\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"batch_size"}],"：自动将单条数据打包成一个 batch。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"shuffle=True"}],"：在每个 epoch 开始时自动打乱数据顺序。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"num_workers"}],"：启动多个子进程并行加载数据，极大地提高了数据供给效率。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"collate_fn"}],"：自定义如何将多条样本合并成一个 batch，对于处理非标准数据（如不同长度的句子）非常有用。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
